DECIDE `intentionally does an act likely to spread infection` f IF
        "Whoever"
    AND f's `intentionally or rashly`
    AND f's `does any act which is likely to spread the infection of any disease dangerous to life`
    AND f's `knows or has reason to believe the act to be likely to spread the infection`

