GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `adulterates food or drink intended for sale` f IF
        "Whoever"
    AND f's `adulterates any article of food or drink so as to make it noxious as food or drink`
    AND f's `intending to sell it as food or drink, or knowing it likely to be sold as food or drink`

