`charge under s 272` f MEANS
    `frame the charge` (f's particulars) "272" "adulteration of food or drink which is intended for sale"
        ((`punishment prescribed by s 272`)'s words)
        (`offence under s 272` f)
        (CONCAT "did adulterate an article of food or drink so as to make it noxious, intending to sell it or knowing it likely to be sold as food or drink", (`to wit` (f's `what was done`)))
