                (`missing unless` (f's `adulterates any article of food or drink so as to make it noxious as food or drink`) "adulterates any article of food or drink, so as to make such article noxious as food or drink"),
                (`missing unless` (f's `intending to sell it as food or drink, or knowing it likely to be sold as food or drink`) "intending to sell such article as food or drink, or knowing it to be likely that the same will be sold as food or drink"),
