GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sells noxious food or drink` f IF
        "Whoever"
    AND f's `sells, or offers or exposes for sale, as food or drink, an article which has been rendered or has become noxious or is unfit for food or drink`
    AND f's `knowing or having reason to believe that it is noxious as food or drink`

@export Whether the accused has committed an offence punishable under section 273 of the Penal Code 1871 (sale of noxious food or drink)
GIVEN f IS A `Public Health Facts` @desc The act, the article, drug, water or air concerned, and what the accused knew or intended
