GIVETH A Charge
`charge under s 273` f MEANS
    `frame the charge` (f's particulars) "273" "sale of noxious food or drink"
        ((`punishment prescribed by s 273`)'s words)
        (`offence under s 273` f)
        (CONCAT "did sell, or offer or expose for sale, as food or drink an article which was noxious or unfit, knowing or having reason to believe it to be noxious", (`to wit` (f's `what was done`)))
        (concat (LIST
                (`missing unless` (f's `sells, or offers or exposes for sale, as food or drink, an article which has been rendered or has become noxious or is unfit for food or drink`) "sells, or offers or exposes for sale, as food or drink, any article which has been rendered or has become noxious, or is in a state unfit for food or drink"),
