    death                    IS `not prescribed`
    `imprisonment for life`  IS `not prescribed`
    imprisonment             IS `or with`
    `maximum term in months` IS JUST 36
    `minimum term in months` IS NOTHING
    `forfeiture of property` IS `not prescribed`
    fine                     IS `or with`
    `maximum fine`           IS NOTHING
    `minimum fine`           IS NOTHING
    caning                   IS `not prescribed`
    `minimum strokes`        IS NOTHING
    `maximum strokes`        IS NOTHING
    `or with both`           IS TRUE

@export Whether the accused commits the acts section 275 of the Penal Code 1871 describes (sale of adulterated drugs)
GIVEN f IS A `Public Health Facts` @desc The act, the article, drug, water or air concerned, and what the accused knew or intended
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sells adulterated drugs` f IF
        "Whoever"
    AND f's `knowing a drug or medical preparation to have been so adulterated, sells, offers or exposes it for sale, issues it from a dispensary as unadulterated, or causes it to be used by a person not knowing of the adulteration`

@export Whether the accused has committed an offence punishable under section 275 of the Penal Code 1871 (sale of adulterated drugs)
GIVEN f IS A `Public Health Facts` @desc The act, the article, drug, water or air concerned, and what the accused knew or intended
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `offence under s 275` f IF
        "Whoever"
    AND `sells adulterated drugs` f

@export Frame a charge under section 275 of the Penal Code 1871 (sale of adulterated drugs), or say why none can be framed
GIVEN f IS A `Public Health Facts` @desc The act, the article, drug, water or air concerned, and what the accused knew or intended, and the particulars of the charge
GIVETH A Charge
`charge under s 275` f MEANS
    `frame the charge` (f's particulars) "275" "sale of adulterated drugs"
        ((`punishment prescribed by s 275`)'s words)
        (`offence under s 275` f)
        (CONCAT "knowing a drug or medical preparation to have been adulterated, did sell it, offer or expose it for sale, issue it as unadulterated, or cause it to be used for medicinal purposes", (`to wit` (f's `what was done`)))
        (concat (LIST
                (`missing unless` (f's `knowing a drug or medical preparation to have been so adulterated, sells, offers or exposes it for sale, issues it from a dispensary as unadulterated, or causes it to be used by a person not knowing of the adulteration`) "knowing any drug or medical preparation to have been so adulterated, sells, offers or exposes it for sale, issues it as unadulterated, or causes it to be used by a person not knowing of the adulteration"),
                (`missing unless` (`sells adulterated drugs` f) "the elements of section 275 taken together")))

§§ `s 276 - Sale of any drug as a different drug or preparation`

-- 276. Whoever knowingly sells, or offers or exposes for sale, or issues from a
-- dispensary for medicinal purposes, any drug or medical preparation, as a different
-- drug or medical preparation, shall be punished with imprisonment for a term which
-- may extend to 3 years, or with fine, or with both.
-- [15/2019]

@ref Penal Code 1871 s 276
`punishment prescribed by s 276` MEANS Punishment WITH
    section                  IS "276"
    words                    IS "imprisonment for a term which may extend to 3 years, or with fine, or with both"
    death                    IS `not prescribed`
    `imprisonment for life`  IS `not prescribed`
    imprisonment             IS `or with`
    `maximum term in months` IS JUST 36
    `minimum term in months` IS NOTHING
    `forfeiture of property` IS `not prescribed`
    fine                     IS `or with`
    `maximum fine`           IS NOTHING
    `minimum fine`           IS NOTHING
    caning                   IS `not prescribed`
    `minimum strokes`        IS NOTHING
    `maximum strokes`        IS NOTHING
    `or with both`           IS TRUE

@export Whether the accused commits the acts section 276 of the Penal Code 1871 describes (sale of any drug as a different drug or preparation)
GIVEN f IS A `Public Health Facts` @desc The act, the article, drug, water or air concerned, and what the accused knew or intended
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sells a drug as a different drug` f IF
        "Whoever"
    AND f's `knowingly sells, offers or exposes for sale, or issues from a dispensary, any drug or medical preparation as a different drug or medical preparation`

@export Whether the accused has committed an offence punishable under section 276 of the Penal Code 1871 (sale of any drug as a different drug or preparation)
GIVEN f IS A `Public Health Facts` @desc The act, the article, drug, water or air concerned, and what the accused knew or intended
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `offence under s 276` f IF
        "Whoever"
    AND `sells a drug as a different drug` f

@export Frame a charge under section 276 of the Penal Code 1871 (sale of any drug as a different drug or preparation), or say why none can be framed
GIVEN f IS A `Public Health Facts` @desc The act, the article, drug, water or air concerned, and what the accused knew or intended, and the particulars of the charge
GIVETH A Charge
`charge under s 276` f MEANS
    `frame the charge` (f's particulars) "276" "sale of any drug as a different drug or preparation"
        ((`punishment prescribed by s 276`)'s words)
        (`offence under s 276` f)
        (CONCAT "did knowingly sell, offer or expose for sale, or issue from a dispensary, a drug or medical preparation as a different drug or medical preparation", (`to wit` (f's `what was done`)))
        (concat (LIST
                (`missing unless` (f's `knowingly sells, offers or exposes for sale, or issues from a dispensary, any drug or medical preparation as a different drug or medical preparation`) "knowingly sells, or offers or exposes for sale, or issues from a dispensary, any drug or medical preparation, as a different drug or medical preparation"),
                (`missing unless` (`sells a drug as a different drug` f) "the elements of section 276 taken together")))

§§ `s 277 - Fouling the water of a public spring or reservoir`

-- 277. Whoever voluntarily corrupts or fouls the water of any public spring or
-- reservoir, so as to render it less fit for the purpose for which it is ordinarily
-- used, shall be punished with imprisonment for a term which may extend to 3 years, or
-- with fine, or with both.
-- [15/2019]

